    <p v-if="!notes.entries.length" class="empty">清單目前是空的。到學校資料頁按「加入私人清單」。</p><article v-for="n in notes.entries" :key="n.id+':'+n.year" class="panel"><h2><RouterLink :to="{path:'/schools/'+n.id,query:{year:String(n.year)}}">{{ n.name }}</RouterLink></h2><p>{{ n.year }}/{{ n.year+1 }}</p><label>申請進度<select v-model="n.status"><option value="considering">考慮中</option><option value="preparing">準備資料</option><option value="applied">已申請</option><option value="waiting">等待通知</option><option value="result_received">已收到結果</option></select></label><label>私人筆記<textarea v-model="n.note" maxlength="4000" /></label><div class="actions"><button :disabled="saving" @click="persist">儲存筆記與進度</button><button class="light" :disabled="saving" @click="removeNote(n)">移除</button></div></article>
